cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Curriculum Mapper: Automated alignment of Computing module descriptors to ACM/IEEE CS2023 Knowledge Areas"
abstract: >
  An end-to-end system for automated curriculum mapping. Combines a
  five-extractor NLP ensemble (TF-IDF, RAKE, TextRank, KeyBERT, BERTopic) with
  Sentence-BERT canonicalisation and a hybrid lexical-semantic aligner to map
  undergraduate Computing module descriptors to the 18 ACM/IEEE CS2023
  Knowledge Areas. Includes a FastAPI backend, a Cytoscape.js web interface
  for human-in-the-loop validation, and a graph-analytics layer for gap,
  redundancy, and community detection.
